                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d85d596d-38ec-3a8a-9db8-992998b03290",
                                        "entry_id": "1ce38894-fdcc-3d2e-864e-5ebacb30af2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An informal social gathering, usually in a natural outdoor setting, to which the participants bring their own food and drink."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d92f018e-960e-4e0c-b4f3-9d550b4543ec",
                                                "sense_id": "d85d596d-38ec-3a8a-9db8-992998b03290",
                                                "text": "We went out for a picnic in the forest."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82aff482-e016-3922-91ce-513ac9032655",
                                        "entry_id": "1ce38894-fdcc-3d2e-864e-5ebacb30af2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The meal eaten at such a gathering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b3dd3a6-2d15-3a87-ae8d-f15fbfb7b8f2",
                                        "entry_id": "1ce38894-fdcc-3d2e-864e-5ebacb30af2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An easy or pleasant task."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7b5937a-cebc-4294-9d17-f9c5ea9926ec",
                                                "sense_id": "8b3dd3a6-2d15-3a87-ae8d-f15fbfb7b8f2",
                                                "text": "We remind the guests that dealing with this problem is no picnic, and to be patient."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd1e161a-f96c-46bd-871b-f196837a39af",
                                                "sense_id": "8b3dd3a6-2d15-3a87-ae8d-f15fbfb7b8f2",
                                                "text": "\"Don't put your hand on me,\" said Uncle Henry irritably. \"I'm crawling with lice. War would be a picnic if it wasn't for lice and dysentery. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "410d9518-5da1-3cce-adb0-ad65c29fc413",
                                        "entry_id": "1ce38894-fdcc-3d2e-864e-5ebacb30af2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An entertainment at which each person contributed some dish to a common table."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5c825cf-6af0-31d5-be0b-07dcbff5c7c7",
                                        "entry_id": "1ce38894-fdcc-3d2e-864e-5ebacb30af2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cut of pork from the shoulder area (above the front leg) of a pig."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d6a5fb5-03ea-418d-a154-0034a74b107e",
                                                "sense_id": "e5c825cf-6af0-31d5-be0b-07dcbff5c7c7",
                                                "text": "Smoked picnics of medium weights - from 6 to 8 pounds - are selling at wholesale at present for about half the price of fancy hams. Standard bacon of medium weights is another smoked product that is selling […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3f3506c-73f0-4bf2-b888-d5843d247496",
                                                "sense_id": "e5c825cf-6af0-31d5-be0b-07dcbff5c7c7",
                                                "text": "Smoked picnics (calas) are pork shoulders with the butt portion removed just beyond the knuckle bone. Shoulder butts are boneless […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd4e9c49-2e27-4314-aa13-bf7a54bb7d4b",
                                                "sense_id": "e5c825cf-6af0-31d5-be0b-07dcbff5c7c7",
                                                "text": "Smoked picnics are sold whole and usually fully cooked. When sold boneless they are called pork shoulder roll.\nCOOKING HAMS AND PICNICS\nRoasting : Roast a fully cooked ham or picnic according to […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "picnic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a2df691-dce5-362a-a0dc-d68bc0bfe37e",
                                        "entry_id": "55408fb7-80ba-32c4-9a72-f0fbaaaee3a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take part in a picnic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "076b6a91-14af-4f86-a2ed-be4f55858d47",
                                                "sense_id": "8a2df691-dce5-362a-a0dc-d68bc0bfe37e",
                                                "text": "And I'll never forget the chillingly instinctive racism. \"Sure is pretty countryside. Pity it's spoiled by the niggers picknickin.\""
                                            }
